  (text "Every key: R-KEY-PU pulls the register input to 3V3, C-KEY and R-KEY-SER filter it, the switch pulls it to ground.\nInputs B and A are the marker straps (0 and 1): tied straight to the rails, no parts.\nThe register's inputs, allocation and marker levels: hardware/cluster/key-marker-and-bits/allocation.yaml." (at 40.64 243.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 1a76569b-69ca-51cf-aeb4-e896fd3504ed))
